mw2coop patch for maps/_ambient.gsc (Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)

Near death a player gets the "deathsdoor" sound filter (EQ and reverb): maps\_gameskill's
playerHealthRegen() runs maps\_ambient::use_eq_settings() and use_reverb_settings() as a thread
ON THE HURT PLAYER, and player_recovers_from_red_flashing() puts the level's own filter back. The
functions below however hard-code level.player (the host): when player 2 was hurt or downed, the
HOST's sound got the filter (QA downaudio, builtin trace: seteqbands/setreverb on entity 0 from
player 2's playerhealthregen), the "red flashing" guard looked at the host's flag only, and player 2
himself heard nothing of it. The filter goes to the player the caller is (self), the level's own
ambience (called with self = the level) still goes to level.player.
@@@ replace
deactivate_reverb()
{
@@@ with
deactivate_reverb()
{
	snd_player = maps\_mw2coop::sound_player( self );
@@@ end
@@@ replace
use_reverb_settings( track )
{
@@@ with
use_reverb_settings( track )
{
	snd_player = maps\_mw2coop::sound_player( self );
@@@ end
@@@ replace
use_eq_settings( track, eqIndex )
{
@@@ with
use_eq_settings( track, eqIndex )
{
	snd_player = maps\_mw2coop::sound_player( self );
@@@ end
@@@ replace
deactivate_index( eqIndex )
{
@@@ with
deactivate_index( eqIndex )
{
	snd_player = maps\_mw2coop::sound_player( self );
@@@ end
@@@ subst deactivate_reverb
level.player deactivatereverb
@@@ to
snd_player deactivatereverb
@@@ end
@@@ subst use_reverb_settings
level.player ent_flag
@@@ to
snd_player ent_flag
@@@ end
@@@ subst use_reverb_settings
level.player setReverb
@@@ to
snd_player setReverb
@@@ end
@@@ subst use_eq_settings
level.player ent_flag
@@@ to
snd_player ent_flag
@@@ end
@@@ subst use_eq_settings
level.player seteqbands
@@@ to
snd_player seteqbands
@@@ end
@@@ subst use_eq_settings
level.player deactivateeq
@@@ to
snd_player deactivateeq
@@@ end
@@@ subst use_eq_settings
level.player seteq
@@@ to
snd_player seteq
@@@ end
@@@ subst deactivate_index
level.player deactivateeq
@@@ to
snd_player deactivateeq
@@@ end
